<title>USA: American General buys back $234 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>American General buys back $234 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Corp said on Tuesday it repurchased 6.4 million shares from an investment bank for $234 million, based on Monday's closing share price of $36.50 per share.</p>
<p>To complete the transaction, American General said the investment bank was borrowing American General common shares and would be buying replacement shares in the open market.</p>
<p>(New York newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
</text>
